# Pre-commit checks

Before creating a git commit in this repo, run the same checks CI runs:

```bash
npm run check
```

That is `npm test && npm run build` (see `.github/workflows/ci.yml`).

Do not commit if `npm run check` fails. Fix the failures first.

A Cursor `beforeShellExecution` hook also gates `git commit` on `npm run check`. Bypass only with `SKIP_CHECKS=1` when the user explicitly asks.
